# local test-run artifacts, not upstream fixtures
/internal/core/data/
# TestCmdRunExpandAfterSplit redirects into a Windows t.TempDir() path via
# `sh -c`, which writes a literally-named "C:\Users\...\Temp\...out" file into
# the package dir instead. The username varies per machine, so don't anchor
# on one.
/internal/externalcmd/C*AppDataLocalTemp*
